    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, based on we company context, we appear to be compliant with the mentioned regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, a thorough review of the specific contract and negotiations with the client's will be necessary to confirm that all requirements are met and that Our standard contractual clauses sufficiently cover aspects such as data protection, intellectual property, and liability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a global budget of 3000000 euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must be compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on The project, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose? our target gross margin percentage is 28 percent, and our minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine our projected margin on this contractour need to estimate the total revenue from The project and then apply our pricing model. a global budget of 3000000 euros over 4 years is 3000000 euros over 4 years, which translates to approximately 750000 euros per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I do not have information about the specific services or products that will be provided under The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can allocate a significant portion of a global budget of 3000000 euros over 4 years to our standard daily rates and infrastructure costs, our may aim for a margin within our target range." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the annual operating cost constraint, our should focus on optimizing costs while ensuring compatibility with the local authority's budgetary capacities. our pricing model includes standard daily rates for various roles, such as senior architects, project managers, and AI engineers, ranging from 550 to 1050 euros per day. our also have margins for infrastructure and software licenses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cost-optimization strategies our can propose include: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Rate renegotiation with subcontractors: As mentioned in our cost sensitivity analysis, our can absorb some budget reductions by renegotiating rates with our subcontractors. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Efficient resource allocation: By carefully planning the project timeline and allocating the right resources to each task, our can minimize waste and reduce costs. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Infrastructure optimization: our can explore options for reducing infrastructure costs while maintaining the required level of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific information about the services and products to be delivered under The project, it is challenging to provide a precise projected margin or detailed cost-optimization plan. our minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18 percent, so our would aim to achieve at least this level of profitability while ensuring compatibility with the local authority's budgetary constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution requires an artificial intelligence component that assists agents in agents daily missions, provides drafting assistance, and guarantees explicability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How does our LLM stack meet these requirements, and what fine-tuning methods or explainability tools would our need to implement? our LLM stack is well-equipped to meet the requirements of The solution. our have experience with deploying large language models such as Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, CamemBERT, and Falcon 7B in production environments. our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, is particularly suitable for deploying due to Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct strong performance on French-language tasks and Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct self-hostable nature, which aligns with the client's sovereignty requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide drafting assistance, our can leverage our expertise in fine-tuning models using methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tuning on a domain-specific corpus. leverage would enable the model to generate high-quality content that meets the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explicability and transparency, our have experience with various explainability tools, including source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. various explainability tools, including source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME can help provide insights into the decision-making process of the model, ensuring that the outputs are transparent and trustworthy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee explicability and transparency, our would need to implement a combination of various explainability tools, including source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME, such as providing source citations for the information used to generate answers or displaying the chain of thought behind the model decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our can utilize our expertise in confidence scoring to identify when the model is uncertain about the model outputs and provide warnings or escalate to human supervisors accordingly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our LLM stack and expertise in fine-tuning and explainability tools make our well-suited to meet the requirements of the solution and provide a high-quality artificial intelligence component that assists agents in agents daily missions while guaranteeing explicability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval has a sustainable development policy, and the solution must reduce energetic consumption and rely on infrastructure with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What is The City of Belval current carbon footprint, and how can The City of Belval propose green hosting partners and digital sobriety practices that meet these sustainability requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company's current total scope 1 and 2 greenhouse gas emissions are 148 tons of CO2 equivalent." ;
